3. Automatic staff registration number
The lecturer portal must integrate with the central registration number generator.

Example staff registration number

HCA/STAFF/2026/001
Automatically generated when an authorized staff record is created.
Registration rules

HCA: institution prefix.

STAFF: staff record type.

2026: registration year.

001: sequential number for that year and type.

Important rules:

The staff registration number is generated when HR or an authorized administrator creates the staff record.

The lecturer account is linked to that existing staff record.

Creating a lecturer account must not generate another staff identity.

The number must be unique and permanent.

Cancelled numbers must not be reused.

Number generation must use an atomic database transaction.

Changes to numbering configuration must be audited.

The lecturer can view their number but cannot edit it.

