HI-TECH College Integrated Digital Academic & Certification Platform
Module specification Academic records management

The Registrar Portal is the official academic records management system for HI-TECH College. It controls student registration, course enrolment, academic progression, examination registration, results processing, transcripts, certificates, graduation and academic records verification.

The Registrar is responsible for maintaining the integrity, accuracy and traceability of students' academic records.

The portal must integrate with the Admissions, Student, Lecturer, Examination, Finance, Library and Principal portals.

